    "created_at": "2023-05-04T07:31:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-04T07:32:17Z",
    "body": "But that would mean if you give a signal to someone they can interfere with it actually working in the end. I very much doubt that is what we would have wanted as semantics. (Though maybe that means events are wrong as well since different pieces of userland can interfere with each other too.)",
