    "created_at": "2023-05-04T07:36:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-04T07:36:54Z",
    "body": "That's already true for web developer-created APIs that accept signals. (There's some existing issue on that.) Perhaps if we hadn't reserved special powers for the browser, and instead used the uniform interface that web developers also use, we would have been more likely to solve that problem.",
